  "description": "Armaf Odyssey Go Mango is a playful and refreshing fragrance that captures the juicy sweetness of ripe mango blended with fresh citrus and smooth woods. This vibrant scent combines tropical fruitiness with a modern, clean base to create a fragrance that feels youthful, bright, and irresistible. The opening bursts with juicy mango and fresh citrus, delivering a lively and uplifting sensation that immediately energizes the senses. The heart introduces subtle tropical and aromatic accords that add balance and smooth character. The base settles into clean woods and soft musk, leaving a balanced, fresh trail that feels approachable, fun, and perfect for warm weather. Odyssey Go Mango is ideal for casual days, vacations, daytime outings, and anyone who loves a sweet yet refined fruity fragrance.",
